1
00:00:00,050 --> 00:00:00,989
Shoots.

2
00:00:00,989 --> 00:00:08,033
High cytokinin gives shoots, high auxin gives roots, and roughly equal amounts give more callus.

3
00:00:08,033 --> 00:00:14,726
Roots is the trap: it is the exact reversal, and it is the most common mistake in this chapter.

